 How to get your tool placed on the list: 

 It must be clear what your product or services does. If regular people can’t figure it out in 5 seconds, it’s not going on the directory. 
 PLEASE READ : 

 👉 Write  unique descriptions . If the descriptions are copied from another website, your tool will go to the bottom of the list (or discarded) and you’ll be waiting longer while I write a description. 
 👉  Content written using AI tools or copied content will be detected and discarded. 

 Display transparent pricing without any hidden fees. If we need to call you to get the pricing, it won’t be included. Please do not submit a tool that has a waiting list or hidden pricing. It will not be added to the list. 
 Have a practical and user-friendly product, free from technical jargon or excessive corporate language. It should be for end users and consumers in general. 
 Please do not submit crypto-related products. 

 Thanks for your contribution to the AI tools directory. 
